      "writtenOn": "2025-11-24T08:22:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  TBH I don\u0027t understand why we enable the flag and say that\u0027s to make SubgroupSize uniform across the dispatch, since this flag says that it makes it varying.\n\nYes Corentin you are right. Now I don\u0027t think we should do that.\n\nActually using `VK_PIPELINE_SHADER_STAGE_CREATE_ALLOW_VARYING_SUBGROUP_SIZE_BIT` and `VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_PIPELINE_SHADER_STAGE_REQUIRED_SUBGROUP_SIZE_CREATE_INFO_EXT` violates the Vulkan Validation Layer:\n\n\"if a `VkPipelineShaderStageRequiredSubgroupSizeCreateInfo` structure is included in the pNext chain, flags must not have the `VK_PIPELINE_SHADER_STAGE_CREATE_ALLOW_VARYING_SUBGROUP_SIZE_BIT` flag set\"\n\n(https://registry.khronos.org/VulkanSC/specs/1.0-extensions/man/html/VkPipelineShaderStageCreateInfo.html#VUID-VkPipelineShaderStageCreateInfo-pNext-02754)",
      "parentUuid": "c95d12dc_d2db39c4",
